    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i noticed you flagged post 3 for being a harmful stereotype. i'm curious about your reasoning on post 2 though. do you think the slang/dialect used in \"stay in your lane fr\" makes it more likely to be flagged as aggressive by users? like, does the tone change how you're evaluating the toxicity of that post compared to the others?",
